WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.960
- Today we're talking
all about connections

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:04.390
that were made during our first season.

00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:05.970
One of my favorite things to do

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:08.760
is connect celebrities
with everyday people,

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:10.260
as well as with each other.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.919
It's always fun to see how
people relate to one another.

00:00:12.919 --> 00:00:15.760
Like when Nicole Byer
reacted to Jason Derulo.

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.249
Check this out.

00:00:17.249 --> 00:00:18.082
(audience clapping)

00:00:18.082 --> 00:00:18.915
Okay here's the thing.

00:00:18.915 --> 00:00:19.748
I said I'm going to talk about it.

00:00:19.748 --> 00:00:20.581
Like teach me one thing.

00:00:20.581 --> 00:00:21.963
What's one thing you could do?

00:00:22.986 --> 00:00:23.819
I wanna be a cat.

00:00:23.819 --> 00:00:27.478
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:00:27.478 --> 00:00:28.311
All right.

00:00:28.311 --> 00:00:29.144
So show us.

00:00:29.144 --> 00:00:31.802
- Okay so (laughs).

00:00:31.802 --> 00:00:34.470
So cats walk in a different way, right?

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:36.160
They walk same arm, same leg.

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:37.240
So it's a little different than us.

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:38.610
So, I mean, it's all those little.

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:39.443
- Oh that's odd.

00:00:39.443 --> 00:00:40.510
- Yeah (chuckles).

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:41.763
- I just pictured myself.

00:00:41.763 --> 00:00:44.010
(audience laughs)

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.690
So it's like that because we go

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.480
from two feet to four feet.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.210
'Cause we're not like just regular cats.

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:50.620
We're like cat people.

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:52.020
So we go in, you know

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:54.430
from standing on two feet

00:00:54.430 --> 00:00:55.820
into going into all fours.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:57.150
So you'll be

00:00:57.150 --> 00:00:58.843
in a conversation.
- That sounds like

00:00:58.843 --> 00:00:59.837
junior high athletics.

00:00:59.837 --> 00:01:00.670
- With somebody.

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:01.503
Yeah.

00:01:01.503 --> 00:01:02.490
Yeah it's a lot of core.

00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:03.597
So you'll be on two feet.
- I'm out.

00:01:03.597 --> 00:01:05.613
- And then you'll just
be having a conversation.

00:01:05.613 --> 00:01:06.446
- I'm out.

00:01:06.446 --> 00:01:07.780
That's why they didn't call me.

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:08.908
Oh shoot.

00:01:08.908 --> 00:01:12.825
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:01:17.454 --> 00:01:18.962
- [Woman] Okay.

00:01:18.962 --> 00:01:19.995
All right.

00:01:19.995 --> 00:01:20.828
(man laughs)

00:01:20.828 --> 00:01:22.224
- I said I was out but I'm in.

00:01:22.224 --> 00:01:23.580
- I tried it.

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:25.424
It works wonders, it works wonders.

00:01:25.424 --> 00:01:26.257
- Yeah, exactly.

00:01:26.257 --> 00:01:27.260
I'm like if you come at a girl like that

00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:29.672
she's like, "Yes."
- No, I don't think so.

00:01:29.672 --> 00:01:30.763
- "I don't even know what's
happening but I'm in."

00:01:30.763 --> 00:01:31.756
No?

00:01:31.756 --> 00:01:32.589
- No.

00:01:32.589 --> 00:01:33.590
If a dude just dropped on all fours

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:34.560
and started purring at me

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:36.470
I'd be like, "What is happening?"

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:38.750
- I would definitely start
(claps) taking my clothes off.

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:40.440
- I would rather a man bark at me.

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:41.657
I'd be like, "Oh, okay.

00:01:41.657 --> 00:01:43.520
"Oh, okay."

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:46.280
- So you can see my face in that clip too.

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:47.113
Like what?

00:01:47.113 --> 00:01:49.427
Like Jason Derulo is back right now.

00:01:49.427 --> 00:01:50.620
Get him in here.

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:52.040
Where are you, Jason?

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:54.000
- What's happenin', Kelly?

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.310
