00:01:57.675 --> 00:01:58.508
- Yes.

00:01:58.508 --> 00:02:00.770
It's like celebrating the launch of our,

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:01.830
get it launch?

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:02.931
Yeah.

00:02:02.931 --> 00:02:03.764
We're clever Jason over here.

00:02:03.764 --> 00:02:04.597
- I love it (chuckles).

00:02:04.597 --> 00:02:06.140
