00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:33.010
They were like, "What in
the hell is he doing?"

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:36.050
- I know it was so impressive regardless.

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:37.720
It was so impressive and controlled.

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:39.253
You're so muscular.

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:42.340
I mean, Nicole Byer's hilarious.

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:43.637
That whole thing was so funny.
- Hilarious.

00:02:43.637 --> 00:02:45.940
- We're kind of celebrating some

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:47.710
of the best ones takes

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:50.400
